---
import { Music2, Radio, Link, Film, Gamepad2, PanelsTopLeft, ShieldCheck, History, Plus, Eye, RefreshCw, Search, X, ArrowRight, ArrowUpRight, House, Circle, Upload, Info, Image, FileText, Headphones, CircleAlert, CircleCheck } from '@lucide/astro';
---
<div class="workbench" data-station-workbench>
  <section class="work-catalog" aria-labelledby="work-heading">
    <header class="work-heading"><p>创作后台 <span>/</span> <strong id="work-breadcrumb">作品内容</strong></p><div><h1 id="work-heading">作品内容</h1><span id="content-role" class="badge">正在核对角色</span></div><p id="work-intro">资料与素材，一起整理。</p></header>
    <div class="work-toolbar"><button id="content-new" class="primary" type="button"><Plus size={22} />新建作品</button><label id="content-search-label" class="work-search"><Search size={20} /><span class="sr-only">查找作品</span><input id="content-search" type="search" aria-label="搜索作品" placeholder="搜索作品" maxlength="100" /><button id="content-search-submit" type="button" aria-label="查找作品"><ArrowRight size={18} /></button></label><div class="work-filters" role="group" aria-label="作品类型">{[['all','全部'],['tracks','歌曲'],['games','游戏'],['clips','视频']].map(([type,label])=><button data-work-filter={type} type="button" aria-pressed={type==='all'}>{label}</button>)}</div></div>
    <div id="work-new-menu" class="work-new-menu" hidden><p>选择新作品的类型</p>{[['tracks',Music2,'歌曲'],['games',Gamepad2,'游戏介绍'],['clips',Film,'视频 / MV']].map(([type,Icon,label])=><button data-work-create={type} type="button"><Icon size={20} />{label}</button>)}</div>
    <nav class="content-tabs work-modules" aria-label="内容模块">{[['tracks',Music2,'作品资料'],['promotions',Radio,'推广歌曲'],['platforms',Link,'发行平台'],['clips',Film,'视频与 MV'],['games',Gamepad2,'游戏介绍'],['home',PanelsTopLeft,'首页配置'],['assets',ShieldCheck,'素材权利'],['audit',History,'发布记录']].map(([type,Icon,label])=><button type="button" data-module={type}><Icon size={17} />{label}</button>)}</nav>
    <div class="work-list-head" aria-hidden="true"><span id="content-list-heading">作品</span><span>类型</span><span>状态</span><span>素材</span><span></span></div>
    <ol id="content-list" class="work-list" aria-label="作品列表"><li class="muted">正在读取作品…</li></ol><button id="content-more" type="button" hidden>查看更早作品</button><p id="work-count" class="work-count"></p>
    <div class="music-feedback work-feedback"><Circle class="dashboard-status-icon" size={10} aria-hidden="true" /><p id="content-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">正在连接内容服务。</p><button id="content-reload" type="button" aria-label="重新核对工作区"><RefreshCw size={17} /><span class="dashboard-only">刷新</span></button><p class="dashboard-only dashboard-signoff">用音乐与游戏，连接更温柔的明天。</p></div>
    <section id="content-reload-confirm" class="notice" hidden aria-labelledby="content-reload-heading"><strong id="content-reload-heading">重新读取当前作品？</strong><p>这会丢弃当前未保存的修改，并读取最新版本。可以先复制修改内容供核对。</p><div class="music-actions"><button id="content-reload-cancel" type="button">保留修改</button><button id="content-reload-discard" type="button">丢弃修改并重新读取</button></div></section>
    <div id="content-recovery" class="notice" hidden><span>有一项操作的结果尚未确认，已保留原版本和操作编号。</span><button id="content-retry" type="button">核对原操作</button></div>
    <section id="work-static" hidden></section>
  </section>
  <section class="content-editor work-editor" aria-labelledby="content-editor-heading"><button id="work-close-editor" class="work-close-editor" type="button" aria-label="收起作品编辑"><X size={22} /></button><header class="workspace-heading"><div><h2 id="content-editor-heading">选择一份作品</h2><span id="content-state" class="badge">草稿</span></div></header><div id="content-empty" class="content-empty"><Music2 size={32} /><p>选择作品，开始整理资料和素材。</p></div>
<form id="content-form" hidden><fieldset id="content-fields" disabled>
<div id="content-identity" class="field-grid"><label id="content-slug-wrap">作品地址名称<input id="content-slug" maxlength="100" pattern="[a-z0-9]+(-[a-z0-9]+)*" placeholder="例如 gentle-night" /></label><label id="content-parent-wrap">所属歌曲<select id="content-parent"><option value="">选择歌曲</option></select></label><label id="content-type-wrap">素材类型<select id="content-clip-type"><option value="short_video">歌曲短片</option><option value="mv">音乐 MV</option></select></label></div>
<section id="content-metadata" class="content-section">
  <label>作品标题<input id="content-title" maxlength="200" /></label>
  <label id="content-artist-wrap">艺名<input id="content-artist" maxlength="120" /></label>

</section>
<section id="work-platform-section" class="work-platform-section" hidden aria-labelledby="work-platform-heading"><header><h3 id="work-platform-heading"><Link size={18} />发行平台</h3><a id="work-platform-link" href="/admin-v2/?view=platforms">管理平台链接 <ArrowRight size={18} /></a></header><p>填写网易云、汽水、Apple Music 等平台的真实歌曲链接与上线状态。</p></section>
<section id="work-assets-section" class="work-assets-section" hidden><header><h3>素材与权利</h3><a id="work-assets-link" href="/admin/music/media/">打开素材库 <ArrowRight size={18} /></a></header><ul id="work-assets-list"></ul>
  <div class="work-upload"><strong>为此作品添加素材</strong><a id="work-upload-link" href="/admin/music/media/"><Upload size={28} strokeWidth={1.6} /><span>选择对应素材<br /><small id="work-upload-help">按素材用途核对格式和上限</small></span><span class="work-upload-cta">选择文件</span></a><p id="work-upload-owner"></p></div>
</section>

<section id="content-promotion-fields" class="content-section" hidden><h3>推广歌曲专门配置</h3><label class="content-check"><input id="content-promote" type="checkbox" />启用这首歌曲的推广</label><div class="field-grid"><label>主推排序<input id="content-sort" type="number" min="0" max="1000000" value="0" /></label><label class="content-check"><input id="content-preview-enable" type="checkbox" />提供独立公开试听</label></div><label>独立试听素材<select id="content-preview-asset"></select></label><p class="muted">关闭试听后不提供试听入口。保存未启用的推广版本会清除该版关联；下架保留封存历史。</p><div class="field-grid"><label>推广平台入口<select id="content-platform-ids" multiple size="4"></select></label><label>关联视频<select id="content-clip-ids" multiple size="4"></select></label></div><div id="content-campaigns" class="notice">正在读取推广链接与二维码。</div></section>
<section id="content-clip-fields" class="content-section" hidden><h3>视频素材</h3><div class="field-grid"><label>视频文件<select id="content-video"></select></label><label>封面海报<select id="content-poster"></select></label><label>视频时长（秒）<input id="content-clip-duration" type="number" min="0.001" max="1800" step="0.001" /></label></div><label>原文字幕<textarea id="content-subtitles" maxlength="2000" rows="4"></textarea></label><p class="notice">素材技术校验不能代替观看核对。发布前请确认画面、声音和使用范围。</p><details><summary>外部发布记录</summary><div id="content-publications"></div><div class="field-grid"><label>发布平台<select id="content-publication-channel"><option value="youtube">YouTube</option><option value="netease">网易云音乐</option><option value="qishui">汽水音乐</option></select></label><label>平台作品编号<input id="content-post-id" maxlength="200" /></label></div><label>真实发布网址<input id="content-post-url" type="url" maxlength="2048" /></label><label>已发布时间（新加坡 UTC+8）<input id="content-post-time" type="datetime-local" /></label><button id="content-add-publication" type="button">登记外部发布记录</button></details></section>
<section id="content-game-fields" class="content-section" hidden><h3>运行与设备</h3><label>游戏运行入口<select id="content-launch"><option value="">稍后确定</option><option value="/games/cat-life/">打工养猫日记 · 现有运行入口</option></select></label><div class="content-checks">{[['desktop','电脑浏览器'],['ios','iOS'],['android','Android']].map(([value,label])=><label class="content-check"><input data-device={value} type="checkbox" />{label}</label>)}</div><label>游戏截图<select id="content-screenshots" multiple size="4"></select></label><p class="muted">介绍页使用独立地址，已有游戏运行地址与存档服务保持稳定。</p></section>
<section id="content-home-fields" class="content-section" hidden>
  <p id="content-home-current" class="home-current"></p>
  <div class="field-grid"><label>主推歌曲<select id="content-featured-track"></select></label><label>主推游戏<select id="content-featured-game"></select></label></div>
  <p class="muted home-help">直接选择已公开的歌曲即可。首次主推会带上已核对的发行平台，试听默认关闭；已生效的推广与试听设置会继续保留。</p>
  <details class="home-extras"><summary>更多展示内容（选填）</summary><div class="field-grid"><label>精选歌曲（最多 3 首）<select id="content-selected-tracks" multiple size="4"></select></label><label>短视频（最多 4 条）<select id="content-selected-clips" multiple size="4"></select></label></div></details>
  <p id="content-home-feedback" class="home-feedback" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
</section>

<footer class="music-actions work-save-actions"><button id="content-save" class="primary" type="submit">保存草稿</button><button id="content-preflight" type="button"><Eye size={17} />核对与预览</button><button id="content-publish" type="button">公开作品</button><button id="content-unpublish" type="button">下架 / 停止推广</button><a id="content-home-view" class="home-view-link" href="/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" hidden>查看首页 <ArrowRight size={17} /></a></footer><p id="work-publish-help" class="work-publish-help"><Info size={16} />确认素材权利后，再核对公开内容。</p>
<details id="work-owner-management"><summary>更多作品管理</summary><nav id="work-owner-links"><a href="/admin/music/reports/">推广报表</a></nav></details><details id="content-language-details" class="content-language-details"><summary>其他语言、简介与故事</summary>
    <label>原文语言<select id="content-locale"><option value="zh-Hans">简体中文</option><option value="zh-Hant">繁體中文</option><option value="en">English</option><option value="ja">日本語</option></select></label>
    <div class="field-grid">{[['zh-Hans','简体中文'],['zh-Hant','繁體中文'],['en','English'],['ja','日本語']].map(([locale,label])=><label>{label}标题<input data-title={locale} maxlength="200" /></label>)}</div>
    <div class="field-grid">{[['zh-Hans','简体中文'],['zh-Hant','繁體中文'],['en','English'],['ja','日本語']].map(([locale,label])=><label>{label}简介<textarea data-summary={locale} maxlength="500" rows="3"></textarea></label>)}</div>
    <label>作品介绍<textarea id="content-story" maxlength="8000" rows="5"></textarea></label><label id="content-related-wrap">相关歌曲<select id="content-related" multiple size="4"></select></label>
  </details><details id="content-track-fields" class="content-section work-advanced" hidden><summary>网站展示与完整播放</summary><h3>网站展示</h3><div class="field-grid"><label>封面<select id="content-cover"></select></label><label>歌词素材<select id="content-lyrics"></select></label><label>站内音频模式<select id="content-audio-mode"><option value="none">只展示作品资料</option><option value="preview">按推广配置提供试听</option><option value="free_full">引用现有免费完整资源</option><option value="existing_entitlement">引用现有权限完整资源</option></select></label><label>歌曲时长（秒）<input id="content-duration" type="number" min="0.001" max="86400" step="0.001" /></label></div><label>现有完整播放版本编号<input id="content-legacy" maxlength="36" placeholder="选用完整资源时填写现有封存版本" /></label><p class="notice">完整播放继续核对原有权益。公开试听在「推广歌曲」中单独设置。</p></details><details id="content-schedule-wrap"><p id="content-version" class="muted">保存为草稿后，再核对公开内容。</p><summary>定时公开与版本回退</summary><label>定时公开（新加坡 UTC+8）<input id="content-due" type="datetime-local" /></label><div class="music-actions"><button id="content-schedule" type="button">安排定时公开</button><button id="content-cancel-schedule" type="button">取消定时</button></div><div id="content-jobs" class="notice"></div><label>已封存版本<select id="content-rollback-version"></select></label><button id="content-history-more" type="button" hidden>读取更早版本</button><button id="content-rollback" type="button">恢复所选版本并公开</button><p class="muted">恢复会产生新版本，并重新核对当前资源与权利。</p></details>
</fieldset></form>
<section id="content-platform-editor" hidden></section><section id="content-rights-editor" hidden></section><section id="content-audit" hidden></section>
<section id="content-preview" class="content-preview" hidden aria-label="私密资料预览"><header class="workspace-heading"><h3>这一版的资料预览</h3><select id="content-preview-width" aria-label="预览宽度"><option value="desktop">桌面</option><option value="mobile">窄屏</option></select></header><div id="content-preview-card"></div><p class="muted">仅供资料与窄屏排版核对；正式页面仍读取公开版本。</p></section>

</section>
<template id="work-icon-song"><Music2 size={20} /></template><template id="work-icon-game"><Gamepad2 size={21} /></template><template id="work-icon-clip"><Film size={20} /></template><template id="work-icon-cover"><Image size={24} /></template><template id="work-icon-lyrics"><FileText size={24} /></template><template id="work-icon-audio"><Music2 size={24} /></template><template id="work-icon-preview"><Headphones size={24} /></template><template id="work-icon-pending"><CircleAlert size={19} /></template><template id="work-icon-ready"><CircleCheck size={19} /></template><template id="work-icon-arrow"><ArrowRight size={20} /></template>
<template id="work-icon-link"><Link size={40} strokeWidth={1.8} /></template><template id="work-icon-home"><House size={40} strokeWidth={1.8} /></template><template id="work-icon-external"><ArrowUpRight size={22} strokeWidth={1.8} /></template>
</div>
<script>import '../../scripts/adminStationContent.js';</script>
